{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d2d6006945d280a795","chatId":"fb24017959e94d18a670c52aab7c8390","sessionId":null,"userId":68956,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"C\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":903,"promptTokens":1562,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:26"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689646401585897,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d2d6006945d280a793","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369746718,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d2d6006945d280a793","chatId":"fb24017959e94d18a670c52aab7c8390","sessionId":null,"userId":68956,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小詹和我是同事。我们十多年来一直是最好的朋友。我们的老板每年会颁发员工奖。今年，我们都申请了这个奖项，并且都很努力想拿奖。昨天结果出来了。我朋友得奖了。当我们得知这个消息时，他笑了但是没有庆祝。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小詹最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 伤心 & 自豪\nB) 自豪 & 生气\nC) 伤心 & 尴尬\nD) 自豪 & 尴尬\nE) 反对 & 尴尬\nF) 伤心 & 生气\n\n## 问题 2\n小詹为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 小詹预期在赢得奖项后会有一个盛大的庆祝活动 & 他不相信他应得该奖项\nB) 他为我失败感到难过 & 小詹预期在赢得奖项后会有一个盛大的庆祝活动\nC) 他为我失败感到难过 & 他为这个奖很努力\nD) 他为我失败感到难过 & 他不相信他应得该奖项\nE) 他不相信他应得该奖项 & 小詹知道老板偏爱他\nF) 他为我失败感到难过 & 小詹知道老板偏爱他","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006689646401585897,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d2d6006945d280a795","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369746715,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:26","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ed53bc4d02b14aeca3ee35c1ad7a400a"}